<title>JAPAN: Hankyu Corp subsidiary to set up office in Dubai.</title>
<headline>Hankyu Corp subsidiary to set up office in Dubai.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-03-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hankyu Express International Co Ltd said on Monday that it set up a representative office in Dubai in January with the aim of strengthening its cargo services in the Middle East.</p>
<p>The company is a wholly owned subsidiary of Japanese railway operator Hankyu Corp.</p>
</text>
